	"Name": "Vile's HD Bachelorette Portraits",
	"Author": "VileBeggar",
	"Description": "[size=3]I stumbled upon Jier's HD Portraits recently and liked how they looked. Decided to make [/size][size=3]bachelorette versions of the bachelors with the assistance of AI image generation and inspiration from AdarinSinner's bachelorette portrait character designs. The vast majority of the work is completely AI based with some manual touch ups and the necessary edits to turn these into portrait sheets. \n<br />\n<br />I'd heavily recommend using [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/14150]Jier's HD Portraits[/url] with this considering the intended installation method of this mod is to just overwrite the original portrait files of the characters inside of the Jier's HD Portraits folder.\n<br />\n<br />Take a look at [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/15199]Beornwahl's HD Portraits[/url] as well for some more alternative options. \n<br />\n<br />I use the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2941]Combined Girl Mod[/url] for sprites and dialogue changes.\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5335]Change Dialogues plus[/url] can also be considered as an alternative option with a rather extensive amount of villager customization, such as sprite options.[/size]\n<br />[size=3]\n<br />Gizzlembos has created a change dialogues plus [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/16171]portrait pack[/url] using the portraits from this mod page. [/size]",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/14634",
